# Vuforia runtime cache
client-unity/QCAR/
# Duplicate of Packages/com.ptc.vuforia.engine-11.4.4.tgz — Vuforia's
# AddVuforiaEnginePackage.cs uses the Packages/ copy; the Editor/Migration
# copy is a leftover and should not ship in git.
client-unity/Assets/Editor/Migration/com.ptc.vuforia.engine-11.4.4.tgz
client-unity/Assets/Editor/Migration/com.ptc.vuforia.engine-11.4.4.tgz.meta
# Vuforia Engine package — vendor binary >100MB, exceeds GitHub limit.
# Download from https://developer.vuforia.com/downloads/ and place at:
#   client-unity/Packages/com.ptc.vuforia.engine-11.4.4.tgz
client-unity/Packages/com.ptc.vuforia.engine-*.tgz
